From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: winawdl <winawdl@invalid>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 09:27:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Advertise HT capabilities in PSFs, not only MIFs

Owly protocol rule AWDL-5 expects TLV 7 in PSFs. Reuse OWL's existing
HT-capability writer so this is bit-for-bit the same capability data.
---
 src/tx.c | 3 +--
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/tx.c b/src/tx.c
--- a/src/tx.c
+++ b/src/tx.c
@@ -372,8 +372,7 @@ int awdl_init_full_action_frame(uint8_t *buf, struct awdl_state *state, struct i
 	ptr += awdl_init_chanseq_tlv(ptr, state);
 	ptr += awdl_init_election_params_v2_tlv(ptr, state);
 	ptr += awdl_init_service_params_tlv(ptr, state);
-	if (type == AWDL_ACTION_MIF)
-		ptr += awdl_init_ht_capabilities_tlv(ptr, state);
+	ptr += awdl_init_ht_capabilities_tlv(ptr, state);
 	if (type == AWDL_ACTION_MIF)
 		ptr += awdl_init_arpa_tlv(ptr, state);
 	ptr += awdl_init_data_path_state_tlv(ptr, state);
